            "heading": "Apps and files",
            "content": "<p>Each product lists its files. In general:</p><ul><li>LUTs: .cube, 33 point, for Premiere Pro, DaVinci Resolve, Final Cut Pro and CapCut, plus After Effects, Photoshop and LumaFusion</li><li>Transitions: project files for Premiere Pro, DaVinci Resolve and Final Cut Pro, and the same transitions as video clips for CapCut</li><li>Overlays: 4K ProRes 422 and MP4, to lay on top in Screen or Add</li><li>Sound effects: WAV, 48 kHz, 24 bit</li></ul>",
